   "routes": [
    "cites"
   ],
   "search_routes": false,
   "update_date_filter": false,
   "note": "cites on publication date and full history; the names and abbreviation search routes are off in this profile (keyless use has a daily credit budget); the update-date filter needs a premium key and is listed as unavailable in every plan. Changing this profile changes the query file hash and therefore the plan; a key in the environment authenticates requests and never changes the plan."
  }
